A studio、キザワスタジオ)","detail":"デモムービー","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:74107","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"KIZAWA studio","creatorId":"vndb:s592","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s592","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s592","name":"KIZAWA studio","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:76179","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"あめい すめる","creatorId":"vndb:s3146","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3146","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3146","name":"あめい すめる","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:76180","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"円堂 くらはち","creatorId":"vndb:s7507","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7507","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7507","name":"円堂 くらはち","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:76184","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"羽沢 向一","creatorId":"vndb:s7984","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7984","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7984","name":"羽沢 向一","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:76185","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"加納 しぐまん","creatorId":"vndb:s11067","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11067","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11067","name":"加納 しぐまん","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:76187","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c70399","characterName":"ゾーゲム","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"93055","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"224176"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16795"],"vndbCharacterId":"c70399"},"originalCharacterName":"ゾーゲム","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a giant of a man who heads a group of opposition parties. He is selfish and arrogant, and will do anything dirty to get money and women."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As a result, he was able to assume the position of effective leader of the frontier fortress."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is plotting to capture the abominable Celicia, who leads the Guard of Honor."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c70399"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本編主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"屈強な肉体を持つ巨漢で、辺獄砦を根城として悪事を働く野党団の実質的なリーダー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は利己的で傲慢、金や女を手に入れるためなら手段を選ばず、どんな汚いことも厭わない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"王国の親衛隊として勇名を馳せるセリシアを忌々しい存在と思っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16795","sourceWorkId":"11285","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"野党団を首領として束ねる巨漢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"利己的で傲慢な性格で、金や女を手に入れるために薄汚いことにも手を染める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その結果、辺獄砦の実質的なリーダー格の座に就くことができた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親衛部隊を率いる忌々しいセリシアを捕らえるべく謀略を画策している。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93055"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d9/d946e3ca918eef523616b80c081219d9a41b50996f1575e45b8871499affe356.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9ab486aba6ba5b530952c5612982acfae90d2ffc4fa307e5835489cbb1e3eb9a.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"尾崎淳","creatorId":"vndb:s32","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s32","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s32","name":"尾崎 淳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:224176:93055:6382:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c70400","characterName":"セリシア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"93053","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"224176"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16793"],"vndbCharacterId":"c70400"},"originalCharacterName":"セリシア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Commander of the 3rd Squadron of the Royal Guard of Graldan. She is the only daughter of a knight's family of prestige but declining power."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a strong, simple, and virtuous person with a solid skill with the sword. She is highly trusted by her subordinates."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c70400"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"グラルダン王国親衛隊第三部隊長として勇名を馳せる女騎士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勢力は衰えているものの、名門騎士の生まれ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男にも劣らないずば抜けた剣の腕前を持ち、その性格は剛毅朴訥にして高潔。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"部下からの信頼も厚い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16793","sourceWorkId":"11285","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"グラルダン王国親衛隊第三部隊長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"名門だが勢力の衰えた騎士の家の一人娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"剣において確かな腕を持ち剛毅朴訥にして高潔な人柄。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"部下からの信頼が厚い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93053"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/4732e2f22279c17ae6d86951ad4c381ffc5b6d10fb0f43d9b512000e9ebfc3f7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/97d83246899b08925cdfa1ad7cc5d2c1cc1a0cdd7750ee292b114ced352cc92f.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山川琴美","creatorId":"vndb:s1173","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1173","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1173","name":"山川 琴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:224176:93053:4799:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c70401","characterName":"ヴァーラ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"93054","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"224176"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16794"],"vndbCharacterId":"c70401"},"originalCharacterName":"ヴァーラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mage woman sent to the brothel where Celicia is held captive as a guard."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a subordinate and lover of Garchik, the commander of the Royal Guard. (Garchik is Celicia's superior officer.)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":") She has won Zogem's trust with her colorful tricks."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is skilled in secret arts and can manipulate the growth of Celicia's body at will. She cooperates with Zogem's humiliating training of Celicia."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c70401"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"セリシアの上官である王国親衛隊総隊長ガルチクの部下であり、その愛人。女魔導師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さらに、辺獄砦のリーダー格・ゾーゲム（主人公）とも通じ、その妖艶な色香で厚い信頼を勝ち得ている女狐。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"セリシアが送られた娼館に監視役として派遣され、ゾーゲムのセリシアに対する凌辱調教に協力する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16794","sourceWorkId":"11285","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"セリシアが捕われた娼館に監視役として派遣された魔道女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"王国親衛隊総隊長ガルチクの部下で愛人。（ガルチクはセリシアの上官でもある）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"色仕掛けを武器にゾーゲムの厚い信頼を勝ち得ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"秘術に長けておりセリシアの身体の成長を自由に操り、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゾーゲムの行うセリシアの凌辱調教に協力する。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93054"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/69/69138be9c143cce6d5afcd1c75441fae797b2225c263ffc20e53175b2bb5f957.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/268250297ca35a7d458738c2c5208ea14fe3d8df8e1fd060d5613e19c6bf87c1.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野中カオリ","creatorId":"vndb:s106","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s106","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s106","name":"野中 カオリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:224176:93054:6409:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c70402","characterName":"ベデュート","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"93056","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"224176"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16796"],"vndbCharacterId":"c70402"},"originalCharacterName":"ベデュート","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A neat-looking mage with long golden hair and blue eyes. He is never emotional and always wears a cold, thin smile."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a hedonistic eccentric who is indifferent to right and wrong and profit, and acts only out of curiosity. He is willing to sell or betray his friends because he likes chaos in a situation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c70402"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"端正な容貌と金髪碧眼を持つ魔道師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感情的になることはなく、常に冷淡な薄笑いを浮かべている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"善悪に無関心で、好奇心のみで行動する快楽主義者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カオスな状況を好み、それによって仲間を売ったり、裏切ることも厭わない冷情な男。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16796","sourceWorkId":"11285","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"長く伸びた金色の髪と青い瞳を持つ端正な容貌の魔道師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感情的になることはなく常に冷淡な薄笑いを浮かべている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"言わば善悪や利益に無関心で好奇心だけで動く快楽主義者の変人で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"状況のカオスを好むため仲間を売ったり裏切ることも厭わない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93056"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"sex":[{"comparisonValue":"m","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c70402","value":"m"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16796","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16796","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"m","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"93056","value":"男"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4a6b6c58446f7b2610c785ed204830dcda08c20c4b452c86fe359d3e222b3526.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ce/ce0200651924ddff4d714dd2b008ed6ff419fdf291e21511ce8dcb94c4f270ed.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"古河徹人","creatorId":"vndb:s299","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s299","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s299","name":"古河 徹人","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:224176:93056:6265:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c70403","characterName":"ヤッキド","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"93057","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"224176"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16797"],"vndbCharacterId":"c70403"},"originalCharacterName":"ヤッキド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A slaver who runs a brothel in a frontier fortress, he is a small man with a broad, fat body."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His fat, flabby face is so vulgar that he is described as having a “smile like a crushed leech\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c70403"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"辺獄砦で娼婦の館を営む奴隷商人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"背が低い小男ながら、恰幅がよく、その脂肪によって二回りほど大きく見える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「蛭を潰したような笑顔」と酷評される下品な男。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16797","sourceWorkId":"11285","spoiler":false},{"segment